                </a>
            </li>
            <li class="share-circle-icon">
                <a href="mailto:?subject=Economic+Outlook%3a+An+Uneven+Economic+Recovery&amp;body=https%3a%2f%2fwww.philadelphiafed.org%2fthe-economy%2f200616-greater-philadelphia-chamber-of-commerce" target="_blank">
